OL,3,GNEWSASubstance released at concert     
OL,4,Acould be linked to robberies, police   
OL,5,Asay                                    
OL,7,FAn "unknown substance" that prompted a 
OL,8,Fmass evacuation at a rap concert may be
OL,9,Flinked to robberies and stolen         
OL,10,Fjewellery at the venue, police have    
OL,11,Fsaid.                                  
OL,13,FMore than 12,000 people were evacuated 
OL,14,Ffrom Manchester's Co-op Live during a  
OL,15,Fperformance by US rapper Don Toliver on
OL,16,FSunday.                                
OL,18,FOne person was taken to hospital and 88
OL,19,Fothers were treated at the scene after 
OL,20,Fconcertgoers reported a "horrible      
OL,21,Fsmell" and some people "coughing up    
OL,22,Fblood".                                
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
