OL,3,GNEWSASubstance released at concert     
OL,4,Acould be linked to robberies, police   
OL,5,Asay                                    
OL,7,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said   
OL,8,Fofficers received nine reports of      
OL,9,Fjewellery being stolen during the      
OL,10,Fconcert but no arrests had been made   
OL,11,Fand the substance had not yet been     
OL,12,Fidentified.                            
